<title>HONG KONG: Righteous interim net loss HK$8.65 mln.</title>
<headline>Righteous interim net loss HK$8.65 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended February 29</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.88 loss vs 0.05 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  5.43 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    8.65 loss vs 0.51 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     107.70    vs 115.79</p>
<p>    Company name		 Righteous (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Righteous (Holdings) is a leather goods retailer.</p>
<p>The exceptional item of HK$5.43 million loss represents severance payment and fixed assets written off resulted from the closure of one of the department stores in Hong Kong during the period.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
